  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Her eargerness catches me off guard for an instant. That's
      a weird ass dream I'm having right now.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Be not afraid, little one. I will guide
      you if needed. Come. Your reward awaits you.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I quickly regain my compsure, and hastily get rid of all
      my clothes. Once I'm fully naked, the goddess stretches her lower lips with
      a claw. As I approach closer, I see there are actually three holes, growing
      bigger as they reach the bottom of her nether regions.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Put it in the lower one.
    TextAlignment: 260
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <SFX>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Item>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Branches>k__BackingField:
  - Text: '- Obey'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7cc5643d0d155214799d3be37b507f8d, type: 2}
  - Text: '- Pick the topmost hole instead'
